su name example meta be map def
su name required ob ve text "PYA_NETWORK" "OLLAMA_HOST" "PYA_MIND_TOOL" ya
prah

from filename "../../module/research_tools.pya" ob name research tools to name research tools be import do
exists su name session name ob text "agent research" ya
exists su name research mind be mind via state "qwen3.5:9b" from discourse "You are a bounded research agent. Use only the supplied research tools. Search once for the question, select one relevant result, download that result, read the downloaded HTML as Markdown, and then answer concisely. Ground every claim only in the retrieved Markdown and include the source URL. Never invent a source and never answer before the search, download, and read steps." ya

ob text "Research the Pyash language and explain in two concise sentences what makes its workflows inspectable." for name research mind with name research tools at filename "examples/out/agent-research" to name text research answer be session do
ob name research answer to filename "report.md" be write do
